flowchart LR
  subgraph R[32 rack-local zones]
    R0[Rack 0 + Shuttle 0]
    R1[Rack 1 + Shuttle 1]
    RN[Rack 31 + Shuttle 31]
  end
  R0 --> P[Rack-facing handoff ports]
  R1 --> P
  RN --> P
  P --> I[8 input feeder buffers<br/>4 slots each]
  I --> L[8 reader-side loaders]
  L --> D[8 fixed readers]
  D --> O[Output staging]
  O -. platter return .-> P
  P -. rack shuttle .-> R
